{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o004b","title":"鲁肃诸葛亮荐庞统刘备重用","accounts":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o004b-account","label":"《庞统法正传第七》正文","text":"鲁肃致书、诸葛亮进言荐庞统，刘备与之善谈，任治中从事，后与诸葛亮并为军师中郎将。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o004b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lu-su","role":"荐举","evidence":["pangfa-e-o004b-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"荐举并任军师","evidence":["pangfa-e-o004b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0048","role":"受任","evidence":["pangfa-e-o004b-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"任用","evidence":["pangfa-e-o004b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"庞统免耒阳令后","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o004b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"pangfa-e-o004b-q","source_order":[37,26,"O004b"],"order":6963}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"lu-su","name":"鲁肃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0048","name":"庞统","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o004b-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-53b12144b6ec212a35ac","layer":"original","quote":"吴将鲁肃遗先主书曰：“庞士元非百里才也〖2〗！使处治中、别驾之任〖3〗，始当展其骥足耳〖4〗。”诸葛亮亦言之于先主。先主见，与善谈〖5〗，大器之。以为治中从事，﹝一﹞亲待亚于诸葛亮；遂与亮并为军师中郎将。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
